+---
+
+Review and correct `applyPatch` so every operation and its failure behaviour conform to RFC 6902.
+
+Cover malformed operations, JSON Pointer and array-index edge cases, operation ordering, and atomic
+failure behaviour. Preserve the API guarantee that neither a successful nor failed patch mutates the
+input document, and update the public documentation to state the RFC-compliant semantics.
